{title: God Whose Love Is Reigning o'er Us}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]God, whose [G]love is [C]reigning [F]o'er [C]us, [F]source of [C]all, the [Dm]ending [G]true
[E7]Hear the [**]uni[A]versal [D]chorus [Em]raised in [Am]joyful [D]praise to [G]you
[C]Alle[F]luia, [Am]Alle[G]luia, [Am]worship [Dm]ancient, [G]worship [C]new.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Word of [G]God from [C]nature [F]brin[C]ging [F]springtime [C]green and [Dm]autumn [G]gold
[E7]Mountain [**]streams like [A]children [D]singing, [Em]ocean [Am]waves like [D]thunder [G]bold
[C]Alle[F]luia, [Am]Alle[G]luia, [Am]as cre[Dm]ation's [G]tale is [C]told.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]Holy [G]God of [C]ancient [F]glo[C]ry, [F]choosing [C]man and [Dm]woman [G]too
[E7]Abram's [**]faith and [A]Sarah's [D]story [Em]formed a [Am]people [D]bound to [G]you
[C]Alle[F]luia, [Am]Alle[G]luia, [Am]to your [Dm]covenant [G]keep us [C]true.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]Cov'nant, [G]new a[C]gain in [F]Je[C]sus, [F]starchild [C]born to [Dm]set us [G]free
[E7]Sent to [**]heal us, [A]sent to [D]teach us [Em]how love's [Am]children [D]we might [G]be
[C]Alle[F]luia, [Am]Alle[G]luia, [Am]risen [Dm]Christ, our [G]Savior [C]he!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
[C]Lift we [G]then our [C]human [F]voi[C]ces [F]in the [C]songs that [Dm]faith would [G]bring
[E7]Live we [**]then in [A]human [D]choices [Em]lives that, [Am]like our [D]music [G]sing
[C]Alle[F]luia, [Am]Alle[G]luia, [Am]joined in [Dm]love our [G]praises [C]ring!
{end_of_verse}
